ace."},{"title":"Flyers & posters","body":"Print and digital marketing materials designed to capture attention and communicate clearly."},{"title":"Brochures","body":"Multi-page company profiles, product catalogues and service brochures designed for professional use."},{"title":"Business cards","body":"Cards that leave an impression and give the right information in the right way."},{"title":"Social media graphics","body":"Consistent, on-brand visuals for your social media presence across all platforms."},{"title":"Video advertisements","body":"Short promotional videos for social media, WhatsApp and digital advertising."},{"title":"Banners & signage","body":"Large format designs for physical locations, events and outdoor advertising."}],"price_range":"Starting from $5 per job","price_summary":"Quoted based on the scope and volume of work required.","price_note":"We give you a clear price before we start. No surprises.","process_steps":[{"title":"Brief","body":"You tell us what you need and share any existing brand assets or references."},{"title":"Concept","body":"We design initial concepts and present them for your feedback."},{"title":"Refine","body":"We adjust until the result is exactly right."},{"title":"Deliver","body":"You receive all final files in every format you need — print-ready and digital."}],"tools_items":[{"name":"Adobe Illustrator","logo":"/images/tools/illustrator.svg"},{"name":"Photoshop","logo":"/images/tools/photoshop.svg"},{"name":"Photopea","logo":"/images/tools/photopea.svg"},{"name":"Canva","logo":"/images/tools/canva.svg"}],"tools_note":"and more depending on your requirements.","cta_heading":"Ready to make your business look the part?","cta_body":"Send us a message and tell us what you need. We will come back to you with a quote and a timeline.","cta_button":"Talk to us on WhatsApp","cta_url":"https://wa.me/263710740387"},"domains-hosting":{"service_id":"domains-hosting","problem_text":"A business still using a Gmail address or operating without a professional domain tells every customer it is not fully serious. The foundation of your digital presence costs less than most people think — and we set it up so you never have to think about it again.","what_heading":"What we provide","what_intro":"","what_items":[{"title":".co.zw and local domains","body":"Registered within 24 hours. You own the domain. We manage everything else."},{"title":".com, .net, .org domains","body":"International extensions registered and active typically within minutes."},{"title":"Web hosting","body":"Enterprise-grade infrastructure. Fast, secure and reliable. Your site stays online."},{"title":"Business email hosting","body":"Professional email addresses on your own domain for your entire team."},{"title":"SSL certificates","body":"Your site secured and trusted by every browser."},{"title":"DNS configuration","body":"Everything configured correctly so your domain, hosting and email all work together."},{"title":"Website migration","body":"Moving from another provider? We handle the transfer without downtime."}],"price_range":"Domains from $5/year · Hosting from $10/month","price_summary":"Full domain registration, web hosting and business email packages.","price_note":"You own every domain registered in your name.","hosting_price":"from $10/month","domain_prices":[{"extension":".co.zw","price":"$5/year","registration_time":"Within 24 hours"},{"extension":".org.zw","price":"$6/year","registration_time":"1–3 working days"},{"extension":".ac.zw","price":"$6/year","registration_time":"1–3 working days"},{"extension":".com","price":"$15/year","registration_time":"Typically within minutes"},{"extension":".net","price":"$20/year","registration_time":"Typically within minutes"},{"extension":".org","price":"$15/year","registration_time":"Typically within minutes"}],"email_plans":[{"plan":"Essential","price":"$20/month","mailboxes":"Up to 5 mailboxes"},{"plan":"Business","price":"$30/month","mailboxes":"Up to 10 mailboxes"},{"plan":"Professional","price":"$50/month","mailboxes":"Up to 25 mailboxes"}],"process_steps":[{"title":"Choose","body":"Tell us the domain you want and we check availability immediately."},{"title":"Register","body":"We handle the full registration process and confirm when it is live."},{"title":"Configure","body":"We set up hosting, email and DNS so everything works together correctly."},{"title":"Hand over","body":"You receive full access to everything. You own it all."}],"tools_items":[{"name":"Cloudflare","logo":"/images/tools/cloudflare.svg"},{"name":"Vercel","logo":"/images/tools/vercel.svg"},{"name":"Netlify","logo":"/images/tools/netlify.svg"}],"tools_note":"and more depending on your requirements.","cta_heading":"Ready to get your domain and hosting sorted today?","cta_body":"Tell us the domain name you want and we will check availability and come back to you immediately.","cta_button":"Talk to us on WhatsApp","cta_url":"https://wa.me/263710740387"},"api-integrations":{"service_id":"api-integrations","problem_text":"When your payment system does not talk to your website, when your CRM does not update automatically, when your team is manually copying information between platforms — your business is paying for the same work twice. Integration fixes this.","what_heading":"What we integrate","what_intro":"","what_items":[{"title":"Local payment gateways","body":"EcoCash, Paynow, Pesepay, Linkwasha, Payonify and more — connected directly to your website or system."},{"title":"International payment gateways","body":"Stripe, Payoneer and other international processors for businesses operating beyond Zimbabwe."},{"title":"WhatsApp Business API","body":"Connect WhatsApp to your CRM, booking system or customer support workflow."},{"title":"Social media platforms","body":"Meta, Facebook, Instagram and X connected individually to your website or backend systems."},{"title":"Google ecosystem","body":"Search APIs, Maps, Calendar, AI APIs and the full range of Google services integrated into your platforms."},{"title":"CRM integrations","body":"Connect your customer management system to every other tool your business uses."},{"title":"Custom multi-system integrations","body":"Any combination of platforms, connected cleanly and reliably."}],"price_range":"Starting from $100","price_summary":"Quoted by scope after a brief consultation.","price_note":"Recurring third-party or API costs from external providers are separate where applicable. We tell you about these upfront before we start.","process_steps":[{"title":"Understand","body":"We map exactly which systems need to connect and what data needs to flow between them."},{"title":"Plan","body":"We design the integration architecture and confirm the scope and price."},{"title":"Build","body":"We connect, configure and test every integration until data flows correctly."},{"title":"Review","body":"You test in a real environment. We fix anything that does not work exactly as expected."},{"title":"Hand over","body":"Full documentation and training so your team understands what was built and how it works."}],"tools_items":[{"name":"EcoCash","logo":"/images/ecocash-logo.png"},{"name":"Paynow","logo":"/images/paynow-logo.png"},{"name":"Stripe","logo":"/images/tools/stripe.svg"},{"name":"Meta","logo":"/images/tools/meta.svg"},{"name":"Google","logo":"/images/tools/google.svg"},{"name":"WhatsApp Business API","logo":"/images/tools/whatsapp.svg"}],"tools_note":"and more depending on your requirements.","cta_heading":"Want your platforms to stop operating in silos?","cta_body":"Tell us which systems you need connected and we will come back to you with a clear integration plan and a fixed quote.","cta_button":"Talk to us on WhatsApp","cta_url":"https://wa.me/263710740387"}}', datetime('now'))
